	  name="Mallesh Kolipaka"
	  position="Web Developer | Backend Developer"
	  aboutMe={`Hi there! I'm Mallesh, a seasoned web developer passionate about crafting clean and dynamic websites. With hands on experience, I specialize in front-end and mostly on back-end development using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and frameworks like React and Django, Flask.\n\nI thrive on creating user-centric designs and optimizing performance for seamless browsing experiences.\n\nLet's collaborate TOGHETER!`}
	  linkedin="www.linkedin.com/in/mallesh-kolipaka-55397a256"
	  github="https://github.com/Mallesh-1124"
	  cvLink="https://drive.google.com/uc?id=1CJjOxFRCyGpjj7HTtbQigS5y4g2NgOl4"
